{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05402","headline":"奉和圣制重阳赐会聊示所怀 · 李泌","name":"奉和圣制重阳赐会聊示所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大唐造昌运，品物荷时成。\n乘秋逢令节，锡宴欢羣情。\n俯临秦山川，高会汉公卿。\n未追赤松子，且泛黄菊英。\n赓歌圣人作，海内同休明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}